{"data":[{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-25T02:30:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114182662956953815"],"id":"2114182662956953815","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":48503,"like_count":308,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":19},"text":"网友投稿：高中“长征主题远足”被指60余名学生遭蜂蜇，伤者检查单被校方收走\n\n近日，某县城一所高中组织高一年级开展约30公里的“长征主题远足”。投稿者称，活动途中缺乏补给，60多名学生遭马蜂蜇伤，送医后检查单和医院记录被校方收走。 https://t.co/ST1ObZMjcN","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114182662956953815"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-25T02:29:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114182440130433255"],"id":"2114182440130433255","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6098,"like_count":9,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"｜沉寂五年赵薇，终于接受最终归宿｜\n\n近日，50岁赵薇现身新加坡高端时尚活动，状态首度公开。\n\n褪去所有争议与锋芒，她妆容清淡、穿搭素雅，神态松弛平静，早已没有当年顶流的张扬凌厉。\n\n现场采访，记者问出无数观众最关心问题：还会回来演戏吗？","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114182440130433255"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-25T02:22:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114180699997835478"],"id":"2114180699997835478","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3823,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"今日所见野花：海滨水茴草(seaside brook weed)、美洲黑颠茄(American black nightshade)、海岸杰普森花(coast jepsonia)、加州蒿(California sagebrush)。 https://t.co/jztccbG2Tt","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114180699997835478"},{"author_id":"1503362006191026180","created_at":"2026-10-25T02:20:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114180252452688228"],"id":"2114180252452688228","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11192,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Worldcoin 项目方关联地址过去 11 小时向交易所累计充值 1050 万枚 $WLD，价值 485.7 万美元 👀\n\n向前追溯资金来源，为项目方在 3 年前转移的 WLD 资金；三天前另一关联地址也曾向交易所转移 161 万美元的代币\n\n钱包地址 https://t.co/fQ61ulStxW\n\n#Bitget https://t.co/mRr8k2McZi https://t.co/